Hi {Owner},

I build websites for junk removal and hauling companies around {City}. {Business Name} has good reviews, but someone with a garage full of junk tonight can't see a price or book a pickup without calling.

I built a sample first instead of asking for your time: prices by the load with pictures of what fits, what you take and can't, an estate cleanout page and a booking page with arrival windows, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

